# The Workshop images' captures (scripts/workshop-images.sh): the Investments tab on Market over
# 30 days, the heatmap, and Oil's Chirps tab with two order-fill chirps in the notices' own wording
# (taken out at the end). Uses Oil, so it sits outside the regular run: pass it by path.
name store captures: the Investments tab, the heatmap, and an Invest dialog's Chirps tab (uses Oil)
monitor remember
monitor close
close-economy
investments-list on
show-economy
wait 1.5
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
wait 0.5
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketRange-30
wait 1
capture store-investments-market
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Heatmap
wait 1
capture store-heatmap
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
wait 0.5
feed-notice Oil Limit buy filled: bought 500 Oil at ₡298 (limit ₡300) for ₡149,000.
feed-notice Oil Take-profit filled: sold 250 Oil at ₡318 (target ₡315) for ₡79,500.
show-buy Oil
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-SideChirps
wait 1
capture store-chirps
close-dialog
cleanup:
close-dialog
monitor restore
investments-list restore
close-economy
